From: CU H10-CU WiFi-NE backport <xcc360@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] net: add rtl9617c_wifi_miss skb flag for native Wi-Fi NE

Mark receive skbs that missed the hardware Wi-Fi NE path so the ingress
nf_hook can clear only our own provenance bit and let later policy hooks
run. Mirrors the base branch's 202-native-wifi-ne skb extension; guarded
by CONFIG_ARCH_RTL9617C so it is inert on all other targets.

---
--- a/include/linux/skbuff.h
+++ b/include/linux/skbuff.h
@@ -1026,6 +1026,9 @@ struct sk_buff {
 #ifdef CONFIG_SKB_DECRYPTED
 	__u8			decrypted:1;
 #endif
+#if defined(CONFIG_ARCH_RTL9617C) || defined(CONFIG_ARCH_REALTEK_TAURUS)
+	__u8			rtl9617c_wifi_miss:1;
+#endif
 	__u8			slow_gro:1;
 #if IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_IP_SCTP)
 	__u8			csum_not_inet:1;
